<item><title><![CDATA[Spain is in the wrong time zone ⏰]]></title><description><![CDATA[Y hay debate para cambiarlo...]]></description><link>https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/spain-is-in-the-wrong-time-zone</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/spain-is-in-the-wrong-time-zone</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Learning Spanish with Myriam]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 06:44:26 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WsfV!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45612e5c-2f51-443c-9c58-674f511a979d_3024x2417.jpeg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>&#191;Sab&#237;as que Espa&#241;a, por su posici&#243;n geogr&#225;fica, deber&#237;a tener la misma hora que Londres o Lisboa? Sin embargo, tiene la misma que Par&#237;s, Berl&#237;n&#8230; &#161;o Varsovia!</p><p><strong>La historia que todo el mundo cuenta</strong></p><p>En 1940, en plena Segunda Guerra Mundial, Franco adelant&#243; los relojes una hora para tener la misma hora que la Alemania de Hitler. Fue un gesto de simpat&#237;a pol&#237;tica, y desde entonces Espa&#241;a vive con un desfase horario permanente. Es una historia muy repetida, pero &#191;es verdad?</p><p><strong>Lo que dicen los expertos</strong></p><p>Es cierto que en 1940 Espa&#241;a adelant&#243; los relojes. Ahora bien, no fue la &#250;nica: ese mismo a&#241;o el Reino Unido y Francia tambi&#233;n cambiaron su hora. Y, seg&#250;n los historiadores, no existe ning&#250;n documento que demuestre que Franco lo hiciera por Hitler.</p><p>Y aqu&#237; viene lo mejor: cuando termin&#243; la guerra, el Reino Unido volvi&#243; a su hora. Espa&#241;a, no. Se qued&#243; con la nueva&#8230; &#161;y hasta hoy!</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WsfV!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45612e5c-2f51-443c-9c58-674f511a979d_3024x2417.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WsfV!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45612e5c-2f51-443c-9c58-674f511a979d_3024x2417.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WsfV!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45612e5c-2f51-443c-9c58-674f511a979d_3024x2417.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WsfV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45612e5c-2f51-443c-9c58-674f511a979d_3024x2417.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WsfV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45612e5c-2f51-443c-9c58-674f511a979d_3024x2417.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WsfV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45612e5c-2f51-443c-9c58-674f511a979d_3024x2417.jpeg" width="1456" height="1164" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/45612e5c-2f51-443c-9c58-674f511a979d_3024x2417.jpeg&quot;,&quot;srcNoWatermark&quot;:null,&quot;fullscreen&quot;:null,&quot;imageSize&quot;:null,&quot;height&quot;:1164,&quot;width&quot;:1456,&quot;resizeWidth&quot;:null,&quot;bytes&quot;:473461,&quot;alt&quot;:null,&quot;title&quot;:null,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;image/jpeg&quot;,&quot;href&quot;:null,&quot;belowTheFold&quot;:false,&quot;topImage&quot;:true,&quot;internalRedirect&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/i/221338302?img=https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45612e5c-2f51-443c-9c58-674f511a979d_3024x2417.jpeg&quot;,&quot;isProcessing&quot;:false,&quot;align&quot;:null,&quot;offset&quot;:false}" class="sizing-normal" alt="" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WsfV!,w_424,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45612e5c-2f51-443c-9c58-674f511a979d_3024x2417.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WsfV!,w_848,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45612e5c-2f51-443c-9c58-674f511a979d_3024x2417.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WsfV!,w_1272,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45612e5c-2f51-443c-9c58-674f511a979d_3024x2417.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!WsfV!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F45612e5c-2f51-443c-9c58-674f511a979d_3024x2417.jpeg 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-noB79L"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p><strong>&#191;Y c&#243;mo nos afecta ahora?</strong></p><p><em>Mi teor&#237;a:</em> creo firmemente que por eso los horarios de las comidas en Espa&#241;a son tan diferentes a los del resto de Europa y del mundo en general. Se come entre las 2 y las 3 de la tarde, y la cena entre las 9 y las 10 de la noche.</p><p>Y eso se nota en el sue&#241;o. Segun las estad&#237;sticas, los espa&#241;oles duermen menos que la media europea.</p><p>En verano, en sitios como Galicia, la diferencia entre la hora oficial y la hora solar puede llegar a m&#225;s de dos horas. </p><p><strong>Excepci&#243;n</strong> </p><p>Las Islas Canarias son el &#250;nico territorio espa&#241;ol que mantiene su hora geogr&#225;fica correcta por lo que siempre va una hora por detr&#225;s que la pen&#237;nsula. </p><p><strong>Ahora te toca a ti &#9999;&#65039;</strong></p><p>Completa las frases con la forma correcta de los verbos de la lista. &#161;Ojo! Necesitar&#225;s el subjuntivo.</p><p style="text-align: center;"><em><strong>adelantar &#183; volver (&#215;2) &#183; dar &#183; tener &#183; cenar </strong></em></p><p><strong>Si quieres ver los ejercicios relacionados con el post, &#161;suscr&#237;bete, es gratis!</strong></p><p>Enjoying these articles? Subscribe and receive new posts directly in your inbox so you never miss one. Subscriptions are free, and if you&#8217;d like to support my work, you can also become a paid subscriber.</p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:&quot;button-wrapper&quot;}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary button-wrapper" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><strong>Sea como sea&#8230;</strong></p><p>Si vives en un pa&#237;s donde hoy ha cambiado la hora, esta tarde te pillar&#225; por sorpresa y dir&#225;s: &#8220;No me puedo creer que anochezca tan pronto&#8221;, o como dice mi humorista brit&#225;nico de confianza, <em>Very British Problems</em>: &#8220;I can&#8217;t believe how dark it is!&#8221;</p><p><strong>Cu&#233;ntame &#128172;</strong></p><p>&#191;Cu&#225;l ha sido tu peor despiste con el cambio de hora? &#191;Llegaste tarde (o demasiado pronto) a alg&#250;n sitio?</p><p>Y otra pregunta: &#191;a qu&#233; hora cenas en tu pa&#237;s? &#191;Te parece raro que en Espa&#241;a se cene tan tarde? Contesta en los comentarios e intenta usar <em>Ojal&#225;&#8230;</em> o <em>Me parece curioso que&#8230;</em> &#128521;</p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/spain-is-in-the-wrong-time-zone/comments&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Leave a comment&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/spain-is-in-the-wrong-time-zone/comments"><span>Leave a comment</span></a></p><p>&#191;Te ha gustado? Tu apoyo me anima much&#237;simo a seguir escribiendo. &#128155;</p><p>&#128073; Dale al &#10084;&#65039; y d&#233;jame un comentario.<br>&#128233; &#161;Comp&#225;rtelo con quien le pueda interesar!</p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/spain-is-in-the-wrong-time-zone?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/spain-is-in-the-wrong-time-zone?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share"><span>Share</span></a></p><p><a href="https://spanish-boutique.com/"><mark data-color="rgb(255, 229, 153)" style="background-color: rgb(255, 229, 153); color: rgb(0, 0, 0);">P. D. Si quieres clases 1:1 conmigo, aqu&#237; puedes reservar tu primera clase de prueba gratuita. &#161;Me quedan pocas plazas!</mark></a></p><p>&#161;Hasta la semana que viene!</p><p>Myriam</p>]]></content:encoded></item>